  "title": "Tasselled Cap Brightness",
  "description": "Global Tasselled Cap Brightness (TCB) index derived from MODIS MCD43D v6.1 BRDF/Albedo products at 1 km and 5 km spatial resolution. TCB is computed using the Lobser & Cohen (2007) formula and gap-filled via the Weiss et al. (2014) method to remove cloud-induced missing data. Composites are provided at 8-daily, monthly, annual, and synoptic temporal resolutions with multiple summary statistics.",
